From 18ed7fe9b976143184abd789f1e819aa92215503 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bala Sai Kosuri <bkosuri@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 02:38:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] add explicit linkage for direct library dependencies

Fix dpkg-shlibdeps warnings caused by plugins referencing
symbols from libraries that were not declared as direct
link dependencies.

This ensures that all libraries directly referenced by a
target are recorded in DT_NEEDED, allowing dpkg-shlibdeps
to resolve symbols correctly and generate accurate package
dependencies.

Change-Id: I4293c9fe19048be60f8de9fcab3ce9ac4d8398b5
Signed-off-by: Bala Sai Kosuri <bkosuri@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 gst-plugin-metatransform/modules/CMakeLists.txt     |  1 +
 gst-plugin-mlaclassification/CMakeLists.txt         |  9 +++++++++
 gst-plugin-mlvclassification/modules/CMakeLists.txt |  2 ++
 gst-plugin-mlvconverter/CMakeLists.txt              | 10 ++++++++++
 gst-plugin-mlvdetection/modules/CMakeLists.txt      |  2 ++
 gst-plugin-mlvpose/modules/CMakeLists.txt           |  2 ++
